WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.726
A form is labels, boxes and a button, with nothing behind it yet

2
00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:08.227
&lt;form&gt; holds the fields and the button.

3
00:00:09.152 --> 00:00:13.252
A label says what to type and links to its box by I D.

4
00:00:14.103 --> 00:00:18.253
&lt;input&gt; is the box to type in. It has no closing tag.

5
00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:20.854
A button sends the form...

6
00:00:23.736 --> 00:00:28.361
But nothing is connected to it yet. Code behind the form does the work.
